@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Method / document navigation. Scope-independent process/navigation; provider or runner examples are not MVP prerequisites.
title Resumefolio | Requirement review and recheck
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
 BorderColor #64748B
 FontColor #17324D
 DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
 DiamondBorderColor #B45309
 StartColor #17324D
 EndColor #17324D
}
start
:Identify revision, scope, criteria and actual participants / material;
repeat
 :Verify statement quality and set consistency;
 :Validate intended use through suitable methods;
 :Inspect related evidence, models and semantic coverage;
 :Record actual findings, impacts and affected gates; <<#FEF3C7>>
 if (Correction or clarification needed?) then (yes)
  :Resolve through elicitation / analysis / specification;
  :Apply actual decisions and recheck affected records;
 else (no identified correction)
  :Retain evidence and review limitations;
 endif
repeat while (Further review / recheck required now?) is (yes) not (no)
if (Blocking gaps remain for the next acceptance?) then (yes)
 :Keep dependent acceptance unresolved; <<#FEF3C7>>
 :Record owner, next action and dependent gate;
else (no)
 :Prepare evidence for the next readiness / baseline assessment; <<#DCFCE7>>
 :Retain actual decisions and tracked legitimate follow-up;
endif
:Record actual outcome and identified revision;
stop
legend bottom
A correction needs recheck evidence; a deferral is not resolution of the underlying issue.
Missing evidence is not a passed review or successful product test.
Only an actual owner decision against separate criteria establishes baseline acceptance.
endlegend
@enduml
